## AI-Powered Kannada Document Digitization and Intelligence Platform

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, AI/ML engineer, product designer, UI/UX architect and technical lead.

Build a complete, functional, modern, production-quality **hackathon MVP named DataKriti**.

This is not a basic website, static prototype, landing page, or collection of disconnected screens. It must be a working AI-powered document digitization application with a polished user experience, real backend functionality, meaningful AI integrations and a complete end-to-end workflow.

Your responsibility is to build the application, implement its features, connect the frontend and backend, test functionality and resolve errors.

